---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import site from '../data/site.json';
const origin=Astro.site!;
const structuredData=[{'@type':'Service',name:'Solo music bookings with Daithí O’Regan',serviceType:'Solo live music',provider:{'@id':new URL('/#solo',origin).href},areaServed:{'@type':'Country',name:'Ireland'},url:new URL('/solo-musician/',origin).href},{'@type':'BreadcrumbList',itemListElement:[{'@type':'ListItem',position:1,name:'Home',item:new URL('/',origin).href},{'@type':'ListItem',position:2,name:'Solo musician',item:new URL('/solo-musician/',origin).href}]}];
---
<Layout title="Solo Musician Kerry & Ireland | Daithí O’Regan" description="Kerry-based solo musician Daithí O’Regan, available across Ireland for weddings, day twos, birthdays and corporate events. Enquire about your date." structuredData={structuredData}>
<main id="main"><section class="section press-heading"><a class="text-link" href="/">← Band &amp; solo bookings</a><span class="eyebrow">DAITHÍ O’REGAN</span><h1>SOLO MUSICIAN<br /><em>in Kerry.</em></h1><p class="press-lead">Live solo music for weddings and events throughout Ireland.</p></section><section class="section service-page"><div><h2>SOLO MUSIC<br /><em>for your event.</em></h2><p>Daithí O’Regan is based in Kerry and available for solo music bookings throughout Ireland. Bookings include weddings, day-two celebrations, birthdays and corporate events.</p><p>The setlist is catered to your venue and occasion. Share your event details and musical preferences when enquiring so we can discuss the performance you’re looking for.</p><a class="pill wine" href="/#contact">Enquire about solo music ↗</a></div><div class="service-details"><h3>Weddings and day twos</h3><p>If you’re considering a solo musician for your wedding or day-two event, get in touch with your date, venue and preferred performance times. Let us know about any particular songs you’d like included.</p><h3>Birthdays and corporate events</h3><p>Solo bookings are also available for birthday celebrations and corporate events. Include the location and approximate timings, together with any requirements your venue has.</p><h3>Setlist and song requests</h3><p>Use the <a class="inline-link" href="/setlist/">draft setlist</a> as a starting point for your enquiry. It covers a range of wedding and event standards. Specific songs and the set for your occasion should be confirmed directly when booking.</p><h3>Solo or band?</h3><p>If you’re comparing options, <a class="inline-link" href="/wedding-band/">Buachailli Dana wedding band</a> is available as a two- to five-piece lineup. Ask about both options if you’re unsure which suits your venue and requirements.</p><h3>Contact and availability</h3><p>Email <a class="inline-link" href={'mailto:'+site.email}>{site.email}</a> or call <a class="inline-link" href={'tel:'+site.phoneLink}>{site.phone}</a> to discuss your date and quote. You can also use the <a class="inline-link" href="/#contact">website enquiry form</a>.</p></div></section></main>
</Layout>
